        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_cf90d1a7270a4a6aa2630e42021b45e7",
      "statement": "The memory service healthchecks the server's browser welcome page because no health endpoint is published, with a 180s start_period for a fresh volume's embedding download, and restart: unless-stopped keeps the engine holding the only copy of the memory graph.",
